{"lyrics":"[00:00.06][Intro: Eric Idle,\n[00:00.40]Young Thug\n[00:00.76]&\n[00:00.84]Tommy Genesis\n[00:01.16]]\n[00:01.22]Some people say it's folly, but I'd rather have the lolly\n[00:03.46]With money, you can make a smash\n[00:05.96]There is nothing quite as wonderful as money, money, money, money\n[00:09.68]There is nothing like a newly minted pound\n[00:11.76](Money, money, money, money)\n[00:13.08]Everyone must hanker for the butchness of a banker\n[00:15.80]It's accountancy that makes the world go 'round, 'round, 'round, 'round\n[00:19.42]You can keep your Marxist ways, for it's only just a phase (Ah, ah, ah, ah)\n[00:23.86]Money, money, money makes the world go 'round\n[00:24.92](\n[00:24.98]Who made the beat? Charlie\n[00:25.66]) (\n[00:25.76]Yee\n[00:25.92])\n[Chorus: Young Thug & Juice WRLD]\n[00:26.00]Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[00:29.32]I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[00:32.52]I go military boys with the angles (Grrah-grrah-grrah, phew-phew)\n[00:35.62]Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[00:39.16]'Lotta blue cash in a rubber band (A lotta blue cash in the rubber)\n[00:42.44]Mount it—, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n[00:46.14]Tropicana diamonds, rock 'em by the tens (By the tens)\n[00:49.06]I'm just drinkin' Act', Kurt Cobain (\n[00:51.14]Uh\n[00:51.18])\n[Verse 1: Juice WRLD & Young Thug]\n[00:51.52]Fresh to death, Gucci on my tomb\n[00:54.56]My chopper sing, it need autotune\n[00:57.98]Bad bitch in my hotel room\n[01:00.78]Take a Perky right before we fuck, then act a fool (\n[01:03.56]Fool\n[01:03.88])\n[01:03.94]Sad money, I got blue face diamonds\n[01:05.64]I'm at the top, and I'ma keep on climbin'\n[01:07.26]I got a **** on my hip, no silence\n[01:10.24]My mama told me, \"Don't trust nobody\"\n[01:11.96]Damn, mama, you seen it comin' (Woo)\n[01:13.48]That's why I don't keep this heat for nothin'\n[01:15.14]Try me, then you're gettin' one (On God)\n[01:17.12]Plus one (Yeah), and a couple more, uh (Yeah)\n[01:20.36]Thirty shots when I am all done (Slatt)\n[01:23.58]Right, right? Did I do the math right? (Money, money, money)\n[01:27.10]Stomp 'em out, wrath in my Rafs, feel my wrath (Yeah, let's go)\n[Chorus: Young Thug & Nicki Minaj]\n[01:30.12]Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[01:33.28]I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[01:35.76]I go military boys with the angles (Grrah-grrah-grrah, phew-phew)\n[01:39.60]Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[01:42.20]Lotta blue cash in a rubber band (A lotta blue cash in the rubber)\n[01:44.92]Mount it—, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n[01:49.58]Tropicana diamonds, rock 'em by the tens (By the tens)\n[01:54.72]I'm just drinkin' Act', Kurt Cobain (\n[01:57.00]Ayo\n[01:57.10])\n[Verse 2: Nicki Minaj]\n[01:57.20]Lettin' him get up in it when he came home\n[01:58.64]After a long bid, you know that sex game strong\n[02:02.40]Headed to the grip, baby, hang on\n[02:05.20]Ding-dong got that Alexander Wang on\n[02:08.36]Wait, free Thug\n[02:11.40]She heard that, \"Hehe,\" and my, \"Hehe\" did the facepalm\n[02:14.58]Pretty no makeup, I ain't have to put my face on\n[02:17.74]Stay in your lane, don't get gassed at that station (Oop, yeah)\n[02:21.98]Give him the chills, I got him head over heels (\n[02:24.06]Oop\n[02:24.14])\n[02:25.14]Suckin' my toes while he massagin' my heels (Oop)\n[02:27.78]He want to lick the wrapper, no Chance\n[02:30.60]They tryna ride my wave, but they end up on the sand (Oop)\n[02:34.08]I got wild hitters and hustlers all on my payroll (Payroll)\n[02:37.36]Type of niggas hit the block, move the crack and that yayo (Yayo)\n[02:40.50]I got wild chicas who do whatever I say so (Say so)\n[02:42.84]'Bout that dinero, so, if you want me you gotta peso\n[02:46.96]Just put a couple grand in some rubber bands\n[02:50.40]Bitches want my look, couldn't get a glance\n[02:53.38]They wonder what I gross like, my name was Lance\n[02:56.22]It's Barbie, bitch, just dropped like twenty mil' on Barbie Land\n[Chorus: Young Thug]\n[02:59.04]Monte Carlo, big sharks on my ankles (Monte Carlo)\n[03:02.88]I drape out all my broads, Cartier bangles (Cartier bangles)\n[03:05.36]I go military boys with the angles (Grrah-grrah-grrah, phew-phew)\n[03:09.22]Gotta upgrade the stars, outer space for me (Yeah)\n[03:12.78]Lotta blue cash in a rubber band (A lotta blue cash in the rubber)\n[03:16.12]Mount it—, she in Barbie land (She in Barbie land)\n[03:19.82]Tropicana diamonds, rock 'em by the tens (By the tens)\n[03:22.48]I'm just drinkin' Act', Kurt Cobain (Cobains)\n[Verse 3: Young Thug]\n[03:25.60]Money on your dawg, they go— (Grrt)\n[03:28.84]On the sidewalk like he gettin' a tan (Grrah)\n[03:32.02]I grow micro-soft drinkin' oxygen (Grrah-grrah)\n[03:35.20]Bitch, I been a boss since a goddamn kid (Woo)\n[03:37.98]Hop out on the block with it (With it)\n[03:39.50]Make him do the cha-cha-cha (Woo, skrrt)\n[03:41.24]I rode the Dropbox with your bae and I got my rocks off (Woo, got my rocks off)\n[03:44.70]She sucked the socks off of me and they was Gucci (Woo)\n[03:47.68]I bent her over in the Bentley Spur and I didn't eat her coochie\n[03:50.46](On God)\n[03:50.86]I'm livin' life as a pimp (Yeah)\n[03:51.78]I'll put a bitch on your shrimp (Yeah)\n[03:53.64]I'm high in the sky like a blimp (High)\n[03:55.28]Ooh, I'll cop a Rolls-Royce first attempt (Skrrt)\n[03:56.94]What's the definition of real? Yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:58.30]When you kneel, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[03:59.36]You just showin' you steal, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[04:00.54]Yeah (Let's go)\n[Outro: Monty Python]\n[04:00.92]Money, money, money, money\n[04:01.52]Money, money, money, money\n[04:02.02]Money, money, money, money\n[04:02.52]Money, money, money, money\n[04:03.10]Money, money, money makes the—\n[04:03.74]Money, money, money makes the—\n[04:08.02]Money, money, money makes the world go 'round\n[04:15.98]Money, money, money, money\n[04:18.04]Mon